    /D8 "unconnected-(S47-Pad2)" "unconnected-(S47-Pad4)" "/left buttons/6Pin-2" "unconnected-(S51-Pad2)" "unconnected-(S51-Pad4)" "/left buttons/6Pin-3" "/left buttons/6Pin-4"
